[329.410711, "o", "WFP Match: evt-02204 | The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a bind to a local port.\r\r\n\r\r\nApplication Information:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\t\t3936\r\r\n\tApplication Name:\t\\device\\harddiskvolume2\\windows\\system32\\windowspowershell\\v1.0\r\nWFP Match: evt-02206 | The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a connection.\r\r\n\r\r\nApplication Information:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\t\t3936\r\r\n\tApplication Name:\t\\device\\harddiskvolume2\\windows\\system32\\windowspowershell\\v1.0\\powershel\r\n"]
